{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1088","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Ehab and another another xor problem"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is an interactive problem!"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Ehab plays a game with Laggy. Ehab has 2 hidden integers $$$(a,b)$$$. Laggy can ask a pair of integers $$$(c,d)$$$ and Ehab will reply with:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" 1 if $$$a \\oplus c \\gt b \\oplus d$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" 0 if $$$a \\oplus c=b \\oplus d$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" -1 if $$$a \\oplus c \\lt b \\oplus d$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Operation $$$a \\oplus b$$$ is the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise-xor operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" of two numbers $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Laggy should guess $$$(a,b)$$$ with "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at most 62 questions"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". You'll play this game. You're Laggy and the interactor is Ehab."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It's guaranteed that $$$0 \\le a,b \\lt 2^{30}$$$."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"See the interaction section."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To print the answer, print \"! a b\" (without quotes). "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Don't forget to flush the output after printing the answer"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"custom","title":"Interaction"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Interaction"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To ask a question, print \"? c d\" (without quotes). Both $$$c$$$ and $$$d$$$ must be non-negative integers less than $$$2^{30}$$$. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Don't forget to flush the output after printing any question"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After each question, you should read the answer as mentioned in the legend. If the interactor replies with -2, that means you asked more than 62 queries and your program should terminate."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To flush the output, you can use:-"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" fflush(stdout) in C++. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" System.out.flush() in Java. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" stdout.flush() in Python. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" flush(output) in Pascal. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" See the documentation for other languages. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hacking:"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To hack someone, print the 2 space-separated integers $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ $$$(0 \\le a,b \\lt 2^{30})$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n-1\n0"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"? 2 1\n? 1 2\n? 2 0\n! 3 1"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the sample:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The hidden numbers are $$$a=3$$$ and $$$b=1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first query: $$$3 \\oplus 2 = 1$$$ and $$$1 \\oplus 1 = 0$$$, so the answer is 1."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second query: $$$3 \\oplus 1 = 2$$$ and $$$1 \\oplus 2 = 3$$$, so the answer is -1."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third query: $$$3 \\oplus 2 = 1$$$ and $$$1 \\oplus 0 = 1$$$, so the answer is 0."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then, we printed the answer."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1088D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1088/problem/D"}